"""Original local buying structure informed by reference-page research."""

def add_local(g):
 p=g['pages'];intro=g['intro'];faq=g['faq']
 contact_links='<div class="local-contact-links"><a href="tel:+919555037373">Call +91 95550 37373 ↗</a><a href="https://wa.me/919555037373" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ask on WhatsApp ↗</a></div>'
 route='/digital-marketing-company-varanasi/'
 def cards(items):return '<div class="servicegrid">'+''.join('<a class="servicecard" href="'+url+'"><small>'+tag+'</small><h3>'+title+'</h3><p>'+copy+'</p><span>'+action+' ↗</span></a>' for tag,title,copy,url,action in items)+'</div>'
 needs=[('01 / WEBSITE','My website needs a better start.','Build or redesign a small-business website with clear services, mobile layouts and an agreed enquiry journey.','/services/website-development/','Explore website work'),('02 / DISCOVERY','People need to find and understand us.','Review search foundations, useful content and landing pages before deciding what marketing work comes next.','/services/seo-marketing/','Explore search and marketing'),('03 / IDENTITY','Our business needs a consistent look.','Define a practical identity and the graphic assets your website, presentations or campaigns need.','/services/design/','Explore design'),('04 / AGENCIES','Our agency needs development support.','Bring an approved brief for white-label implementation, review milestones and documented handover.','/agency-partnerships/','Discuss an agency pilot')]
 localfaq=[('What digital marketing services can I discuss with SiteSutra in Varanasi?','Start with your website, technical and local-search foundations, useful service content, campaign landing pages or brand assets. We agree the actual channels, implementation tasks and reporting before quoting. Agency partners have a separate white-label delivery route.'),('How much does digital marketing or a website cost?','Request a tailored quote. Pages, content readiness, integrations, migration and support affect the work. A proposal separates project fees, recurring tools, optional maintenance and any advertising spend; no fixed package is implied.'),('Should I start with SEO, ads or a website redesign?','Start with the buyer journey. If the service is unclear or enquiries cannot be received, fix those foundations first. If the journey already works, review available search and campaign evidence before choosing a channel.'),('Can you help with local SEO and Google Business Profile?','A scoped review can cover service information, contact consistency, crawlable pages and the eligibility or access questions for a business profile. Profile ownership and published business facts must be verified with you. Maps placement and indexing cannot be guaranteed.'),('Do you provide social media marketing and paid advertising?','Content planning, campaign requirements, creative assets and landing pages can be scoped around your goal. Confirm the platform, account access, deliverables, management responsibilities and separate media budget before work starts; an ongoing posting or ad-management package is not included by default.'),('How do I choose the best digital marketing company in Varanasi?','Compare the proposed scope, relevant work, named responsibilities, account ownership and how real enquiries will be measured. Ask what each example actually demonstrates. Our buying guide provides a checklist; no agency ranking is claimed.'),('Will I work directly with the founder?','Yes. Kumar Saurabh Mishra is your direct contact for scope, reviews and handover. SiteSutra is based in Varanasi and works with businesses and agencies remotely; any in-person arrangement must be agreed.'),('How long will it take to see results?','Delivery milestones depend on scope, content and approvals. Search and commercial outcomes also depend on factors beyond delivery. Agree a baseline, review dates and useful measures; there is no universal ranking timeline or guaranteed lead count.')]
 localintro='SiteSutra is a founder-led digital studio based in Varanasi. Bring your website, search, content or design priorities to one conversation, then agree a clear scope with Kumar Saurabh Mishra.'
 body=intro('VARANASI / WEBSITES, DESIGN & MARKETING','Digital marketing company<br>in Varanasi.',localintro)
 body+=contact_links
 body+='<section class="local-start"><div class="sectionhead"><div><span class="eyebrow">START WITH THE BUSINESS NEED</span><h2>What needs to work better?</h2></div><p>A clear starting point makes the scope, budget and next step easier to agree.</p></div>'+cards(needs)+'</section>'
 body+='<section class="reading"><h2>Connected services, with a clear job for each.</h2><h3>Website design and development</h3><p>Your website should explain the offer and make the next action easy. Scope responsive pages, content responsibilities, enquiry or booking integrations, search foundations and handover. For a redesign, review existing URLs and useful content before replacing them. <a href="/services/website-development/">See website deliverables</a>.</p><h3>SEO, local-search foundations and content</h3><p>Review crawl access, page structure, service information, metadata and internal links. Plan content around the questions your buyers ask. Local-search work starts with accurate business facts and verified account access. <a href="/services/seo-marketing/">See technical SEO and search-marketing scope</a>.</p><h3>Campaign planning and landing pages</h3><p>Define audience, offer, creative requirements and the page people reach after a campaign click. Agree the platform, implementation responsibilities and separate advertising budget before starting. Review actual received enquiries separately from clicks.</p><h3>Brand identity and graphic design</h3><p>Bring consistency to your website and marketing materials through an agreed identity system, templates and named assets. <a href="/services/design/">See design deliverables</a>.</p></section>'
 body+='<section class="capabilities"><div class="sectionhead"><div><span class="eyebrow">BUSINESS CONTEXT / ILLUSTRATIVE BRIEFS</span><h2>Different businesses.<br>Different starting points.</h2></div><p>These examples help define a brief; they are not client engagements.</p></div><div class="local-scenarios"><article><h3>Local service business</h3><p>A home-repair business may need clear services, accurate coverage information and a dependable enquiry route before adding a campaign.</p></article><article><h3>Retail or homeware brand</h3><p>A shop may first need product information, materials and enquiry paths. Transactions, inventory and delivery systems need a separately agreed commerce scope.</p></article><article><h3>Professional or studio practice</h3><p>A practice may need project stories, a clear explanation of its work and a consultation booking route. Client material needs permission before publication.</p></article><article><h3>Design or marketing agency</h3><p>An agency may need an approved design implemented under its brand, with review stages, source delivery and client-contact boundaries.</p></article></div></section>'
 body+='<section><div class="sectionhead"><div><span class="eyebrow">HOW WE START</span><h2>From a question<br>to an agreed project.</h2></div><p>Direct founder involvement, with written decisions.</p></div><div class="process"><div><span>01</span><h3>Discuss</h3><p>Bring the audience, current website, goal and constraints.</p></div><div><span>02</span><h3>Define</h3><p>Agree deliverables, exclusions, dependencies, fee and review points.</p></div><div><span>03</span><h3>Build & review</h3><p>Inspect the work in a preview and test the agreed visitor journey.</p></div><div><span>04</span><h3>Launch & hand over</h3><p>Approve the release, receive access and decide any support scope.</p></div></div><p><a class="textlink" href="/guides/scope/">Prepare a brief and acceptance checklist ↗</a></p></section>'
 body+='<section class="reading"><h2>Why work with SiteSutra?</h2><ul><li>Speak directly with the founder doing the work.</li><li>Receive a written scope and review milestones before delivery.</li><li>Agree account ownership, source files and handover.</li><li>Inspect working examples instead of relying on broad promises.</li></ul><h2>See the work you can inspect today.</h2><p><a href="/work/olive-earth/">Olive & Earth</a> demonstrates product browsing and a local demo bag. <a href="/work/form-space/">Form / Space</a> demonstrates project stories and a consultation brief. Both are original concepts, with clear demonstration boundaries. <a href="/work/">Explore the case studies and live demos</a>.</p><h2>Agree a scope that fits your next step.</h2><p>Start with a defined website project, redesign review, search audit or agency pilot. Request a tailored quote. Ongoing marketing, provider subscriptions and maintenance are included only when specified. <a href="/guides/costs/">Understand the cost questions</a> before comparing proposals.</p></section>'
 body+='<section><span class="eyebrow">BEFORE YOU BOOK</span><h2>Digital marketing questions<br>from Varanasi businesses.</h2>'+faq(localfaq)+'</section>'
 body+='<section class="reading"><h2>Still comparing agencies?</h2><p>Read <a href="/blog/choosing-digital-marketing-company-varanasi/">how to choose a digital marketing company in Varanasi</a> for an evidence and ownership checklist. Our <a href="/guides/">buyer guides</a> include scope tools, cost questions, editing demonstrations and a sample redirect plan.</p></section><section class="editorialclosing"><h2>Tell me what your business needs next.</h2><p>A new website, a clearer enquiry journey, a search review or additional agency capacity. Bring your starting point to a 15-minute discovery call.</p><a class="btn orange" href="/#booking">Book a discovery call ↗</a><a class="bookingfallback" href="/contact/">Prefer email? Send a project enquiry ↗</a></section>'
 p[route]=('Digital Marketing Company in Varanasi',body)
 g['descriptions'][route]='Founder-led website development, SEO and search-marketing planning, brand design and agency support in Varanasi. Define your scope with SiteSutra.'
 t,b=p['/'];b=b.replace('FOUNDER-LED DIGITAL STUDIO · BASED IN INDIA','FOUNDER-LED DIGITAL STUDIO · VARANASI, INDIA')
 b=b.replace('I design, develop and redesign websites for small businesses, and provide white-label web development for agencies. You work directly with me, from the first brief through testing and handover.','Based in Varanasi, I design and develop small-business websites, improve existing sites, and connect them with SEO, content and design support. Agencies can work with me as a white-label web development partner.')
 b=b.replace('For businesses and agency partners, in India and beyond.','For Varanasi businesses and agency partners, in India and beyond.')
 section='<section class="local-overview"><div class="sectionhead"><div><span class="eyebrow">WEBSITES & DIGITAL MARKETING / VARANASI</span><h2>A useful website.<br>A clear route to enquiries.</h2></div><div><p>Start with the business problem: an outdated website, unclear services, search foundations or a campaign that needs a better landing page.</p><a class="textlink" href="'+route+'">Digital marketing services in Varanasi ↗</a></div></div>'+cards(needs)+'</section>'
 position=b.index('<section class="capabilities">');b=b[:position]+section+b[position:]
 # The added need-led section replaces the repeated four-service block on home.
 start=b.index('<section class="capabilities">',position+len(section));end=b.index('</section>',start)+len('</section>');b=b[:start]+b[end:]
 b=b.replace('<div class="heronote">',contact_links+'<div class="heronote">',1)
 p['/']=('Website Design & Digital Marketing in Varanasi',b)
 g['descriptions']['/']='SiteSutra, a founder-led studio in Varanasi for small-business website design, redesign, SEO and digital marketing planning, plus white-label agency development.'
 for target in ['/services/','/services/website-development/','/services/seo-marketing/','/about/','/contact/']:
  t,b=p[target]
  copy='<p class="local-link">Based in Varanasi, working with businesses and agency partners in India and beyond. <a href="'+route+'">Explore local website and digital marketing support ↗</a></p>'
  end=b.index('</section>');b=b[:end]+copy+(contact_links if target=='/contact/' else '')+b[end:]
  p[target]=(t,b)
 g['nav']=g['nav'].replace('<a href="/services/">Services</a>','<a href="/services/">Services</a>')
